newsetting auto_approve
onoff
default 1
label "Approve new and changed DLLs automatically"
tip "Off: each new or changed DLL waits for approval, asked at startup or given here. Takes effect next launch."

newsetting script_log
onoff
default 0
label "Enable copious logs"
tip "Mods' own lines in coe5mod.log too. For a mod author's bug report."

newsetting lan_rehearsal
onoff
default 0
label "Rehearse LAN games in single player"
tip "For mod authors. Content mods' scripts restart at each human turn's start and end, keeping only coe5.gameData and coe5.playerData. Writes a LAN client can't make are refused during the turn."

newsetting cache_player_arguments
onoff
default 0
restart
label "Reuse numeric arguments in turn-start player rules"
tip "Windows CoE5 5.43. Speeds up repeated +player conditions in content mods. The game resolves the player for every condition."

newsettingheader "Mac only"

newsetting mac_workshop_list
onoff
default 1
restart
label "List subscribed Workshop mods on the Mods screen"
tip "Mac only. CoE5SE lists Workshop mods for the game, which can't ask Steam. Off: only mods in ~/.coe5/mods."

newsettingheader "Graphics"

newsetting graphics_changes
onoff
default 1
restart
label "Use CoE5SE graphics changes"
tip "Off uses native graphics and frame controls for all settings below. Takes effect next launch. CoE5 5.43 only."

newsetting smoother_map_rendering
onoff
default 1
restart
parent graphics_changes
label "Use texture array batching on the world map"
tip "Batches map decorations at every quality, plus compatible terrain and army sprites on Windows. Preserves original detail and order. Off by default on NVIDIA. Takes effect next launch."

newsetting optimize_map_textures
onoff
default 0
restart
parent graphics_changes
label "Speed up world map texture preparation"
tip "Requires world map batching on Windows. Reuses matching mipmaps and speeds up compatible texture copies and external army sprites. Takes effect next launch."

newsetting scene_sprite_batching
onoff
default 0
restart
parent graphics_changes
label "Use texture array batching in battles"
tip "Windows CoE5 5.43. Batches compatible terrain, unit sprites, spell particles and projectiles with original detail and order. Unsupported draws stay native. Takes effect next launch."

newsetting gui_frame_batching
onoff
default 0
restart
parent graphics_changes
label "Batch textured scrollbars and tooltip frames"
tip "Windows CoE5 5.43. Groups compatible scrollbar and tooltip frame pieces using the original texture and drawing order."

newsetting frame_controls
onoff
default 1
restart
parent graphics_changes
label "Frame Rate Limiting"
tip "Adds high-refresh FPS choices, GPU wait and optional precise pacing. Off installs no frame-control hooks or menu choices. Takes effect next launch."
